{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Case","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentatio